The battle lasted just long enough for [[Maxie]] to escape in his powered-up submarine. It is imperative that you give chase, but you have no way to follow him underwater. Instead, you are restricted to the water's surface for now. Take the western warp panel for a shortcut to the cave entrance. Outside, the Grunt and his {{p|Wailmer}} have disappeared from the beach, clearing the way to the eastern ocean.

