===1F===
Climb out of the water and up the stairway. At the top, a single Grunt patrols around the pool of water. Battle him and head down the stairs to the northeast.

===B1F (West side; Northeast)===
There are two [[warp panel]]s in the northeast room. Step on the eastern panel first to reach the east-central room and a [[Max Elixir]], then warp back. Step on the other panel to reach the northwest panel in the southern room. Pass by two more Grunts and take the warp panel in the southwest corner. 

===B1F (East side)===
The previous warp panel leads to the north side of a small room with several more. Follow them in the correct order—left, center, left, left—to reach the central room on B1F. 

===B1F (West side; Central)===
In [[Archie]]'s office, there are four items near the western wall. The two nearest items are actually {{p|Electrode}}, waiting to attack unsuspecting intruders. The item to the southwest is a [[Nugget]], and the final item is a [[Master Ball]]. This improved kind of Poké Ball has a 100% success rate, so be sure to save it for a hard-to-catch Pokémon! Be sure to grab it, because after your next [[Badge]], this base becomes completely inaccessible for you!

Backtrack through the warp-filled hallway to return to the southernmost room on B1F. Step on the southeast warp panel to reach the north-central room. Take the stairs down to B2F.

===B2F (Northeast)===
Go south and step on the warp panel there to be transported a short distance to the west; collect the [[Nest Ball]] from this enclosed area before warping back. Head northeast past another patrolling Grunt and take the warp panel there to the northwest room. Climb the stairs back to B1F.

===B1F (West side; Northwest)===
Battle past the single Grunt and climb down the stairs to the northeast.

===B2F (North-northwest)===
Battle the female Grunt and step on the warp panel to the southwest. This leads to the southeast part of B2F.

===B2F (Southeast)===
Go west to find one of the Aqua Admins, [[Matt]], standing at the water's edge. A large shadow can be seen under the surface. Defeat him to stop [[Archie]]'s escape!

