===Treasure Hunter's house===
The single house in the area belongs to a man known as the [[Treasure Hunter|Diving Treasure Hunter]]. He enjoys making deep-sea dives to collect [[Shard]]s resting at the bottom. He asks that you bring him any Shards that you may find, and trades an [[Evolution stone]] in exchange for each one.

